# The environment variables CF_API_TOKEN, HA_IP, MEDIA_IP, and SERVICES_IP hold
# the personal values of this file. The agenix secret caddy/environment.age
# feeds them to the container. A variable that is not set stops Caddy at
# startup, and Caddy names the variable.

